ts3j
====

This directory contains a vendored copy of ts3j:

  https://github.com/Manevolent/ts3j
  Copyright (C) Manevolent and contributors
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Local modifications for the Android direct client:

- `util/Ts3Crypt`: does not register the Bouncy Castle JCE provider; the
  lightweight API is used directly and Android has its own `BC` provider.
- `identity/LocalIdentity`: identity INI reading is a small built-in parser so
  the Android app does not need ini4j (and its `java.beans` dependency).
- `protocol/socket/client/LocalTeamspeakClientSocket`: listener dispatch is
  safe after `close()`; the redundant command debug logging was removed.
- `protocol/packet/handler/client/LocalClientHandlerFull`: a command that fails
  is logged instead of terminating the network reader.
- `protocol/socket/client/LocalTeamspeakClientSocket`: retains upstream's
  `return_code` command parameter; the direct client does not rely on
  `channellist`/`clientlist` for its directory.
